<rules>
<rule id="f4c4-f439-e54e-5d8a" name="Choosing a Legion" hidden="false">
<description>Every Legiones Astartes Detachment must belong to one of the Space Marine Legions. All models with the Legiones Astartes special rule gain the named version of that rule for this Legion.</description>
</rule>
